1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,020
In 1324, one man walked into Cairo with

2
00:00:02,973 --> 00:00:05,660
so much gold that he accidentally crashed the

3
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:06,620
economy.

4
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,020
His name was Mansa Musa and he may

5
00:00:08,936 --> 00:00:11,260
have been the richest person who ever lived.

6
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:14,060
Hi, I'm Sterling, and today we're finding out

7
