how being too rich can actually break an

8
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:16,940
economy.

9
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,260
Let's go back seven hundred years, to West

10
00:00:19,229 --> 00:00:20,140
Africa.

11
00:00:20,136 --> 00:00:22,940
Mansa Musa ruled the Mali Empire, which stretched

12
00:00:22,872 --> 00:00:25,020
from the Atlantic coast far into the interior

13
00:00:24,947 --> 00:00:26,220
of West Africa.

14
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,940
And Mali had something the whole world wanted

15
00:00:28,936 --> 00:00:29,740
gold.

16
00:00:29,704 --> 00:00:31,540
Lots and lots of gold.

17
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:33,260
Its mines were among the richest in the

18
00:00:33,227 --> 00:00:35,740
world, and Mali's gold flowed across the Sahara

19
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:38,380
to North Africa, Europe and the Middle East.

20
00:00:38,413 --> 00:00:41,260
So in 1324, when Mansa Musa set off

21
