22
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,540
exactly pack light.

23
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:47,980
Chroniclers described an enormous caravan, by some accounts

24
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,700
tens of thousands of people, and camels loaded

25
00:00:50,632 --> 00:00:51,660
with gold.

26
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,740
When he reached Cairo, Mansa Musa did what

27
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:55,900
