28
00:00:55,933 --> 00:00:57,460
He spent gold.

29
00:00:57,453 --> 00:00:58,980
He gave gold away.

30
00:00:58,973 --> 00:01:01,180
To officials, to the poor, to pretty much

31
00:01:01,124 --> 00:01:02,060
