32
00:01:02,650 --> 00:01:05,220
And that's when things started to go wrong.

33
00:01:05,187 --> 00:01:07,740
Suddenly, Cairo was flooded with gold.

34
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,980
And here's the rule that runs every economy

35
00:01:09,933 --> 00:01:12,940
