Atlas, Mansa Musa is drawn on a throne,

52
00:01:46,550 --> 00:01:47,820
holding a golden nugget.

53
00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:50,380
But Mansa Musa wasn't just a big spender.

54
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,780
Back home, he built mosques, and helped make

55
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:55,100
Timbuktu a famous center of learning.

56
00:01:55,133 --> 00:01:56,540
So what's the lesson here?

57
00:01:56,533 --> 00:01:59,220
Money is only valuable because it's scarce.

58
00:01:59,167 --> 00:02:01,100
Flood the market with gold, or print too

59
00:02:01,032 --> 00:02:03,180
much money, and every coin buys a little

60
00:02:03,176 --> 00:02:03,740
less.

61
